* Single battery port. P, N are the battery rail. H, L are the DC-link rail.
* D is signed phase shift as a fraction of HALF a switching period.
* Positive D = discharge into the link. Stiff external DC rails are required.
.subckt DAB P N H L params: D=0.16 FSW=50k NSEC=14 LK=1.5u LM=180u RP=3m RLO=1m RHI=35m DT=120n START=0 STOP=1e9 IMAG0=0
Vpermit PWM_PERMIT N 3.3
.include dab-control.inc
.include dab-power.inc
.ends DAB

* The permit is supplied by external protection and referenced to N.
.subckt DAB_PERMITTED P N H L PWM_PERMIT params: D=0.16 FSW=50k NSEC=14 LK=1.5u LM=180u RP=3m RLO=1m RHI=35m DT=120n START=0 STOP=1e9 IMAG0=0
.include dab-control.inc
.include dab-power.inc
.ends DAB_PERMITTED
